Note on grade at application time:
  LendingClub assigns grade/sub_grade during the application review process.
  In practice, grade is part of the loan offer presented to investors before
  funding. It is an application-time feature with the caveat that it is
  assigned by the lender, not self-reported. The grade-free variant quantifies
  the performance cost if grade is treated as unavailable (e.g., if deploying
  at pre-review stage where grade has not yet been assigned).
